   "analysis": "<p>上个段落提到,一个故事最重要的并不是它的故事梗概,而是其中的细节。真正喜欢的人会不停揣摩,感受那些细节。作者明白了这一点,也觉得遇到了今后和他志同道合的好朋友,因此选第2项。</p><p><br/></p><p><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">参考译文：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">这很有趣！</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">每年一到夏天，我</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">就</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">会在自家的书房</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">举办</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">原创故事的</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">分享会。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">我的家在山梨县的小渊泽</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，地处高原，很是凉爽。因为可以</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">自由参加，</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">所以</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">很多大人和小孩</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">连续多日都会前来</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">那是去年夏天的事情。</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">有一个和</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">住在附近别墅的老奶奶</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">一起来的小学二年级的小男孩</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。好像非常喜欢故事。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">因此，</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">那个孩子一来</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">我就想着</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">讲</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">个</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">新故事。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">但是，这样</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">连着来了几天后</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">我手头</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">的故事也就讲完了</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。倒也不是没有，但今年的新作品是有限的，我也想让其他人听一下新作品。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">那天，我望了一眼</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">前来的人</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">我留意到只要我能够让小男孩忍耐一下，再听一遍同样的故事</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">那我就能把有趣的故事讲给其他人听了。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">因此，我</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">一边想着对不住他</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，一边开口</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">说道</span>“接下来讲一个名为</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">八之岳的雾</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">的故事</span>”</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">于是，男孩的脸笑咪咪的</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">看</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">上去</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">很高兴似的说道</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">“</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">这个很有趣</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">！</span>”</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">在那个瞬间，我恍然大悟。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">我太小看这个孩子了。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">讲重复的故事绝不是一件坏事</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">当不习惯听</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">故事的孩子</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">遇到一个他们知道的</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">故事</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑\">时会说</span>“</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">啊，那个，我知道</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">”，然后就这样结束了</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。他们认为</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">了解了故事梗概就是了解了故事，知道了全部。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">但是，那个孩子不是这样的。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">故事里</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">重要的不是</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">它的梗概</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。而是说话的措辞</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">、</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">呼吸</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">、那种心惊肉跳</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，那种</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">荒唐的感觉</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。那是无论</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">听</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">几次都要</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">细心品味</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">的东西。因此喜欢相声的人</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">会</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">为了听</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">同样的故事会一次又一次地去曲艺场</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:32px\"><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">从那之后</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">我们就步入了同样的轨道</span><span style=\";font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:16px\">，我觉得遇到了很好的伙伴。</span></p><p><br/></p>",
